# Dyadrine, Synthesis Amalgam's token copy: Bot2's Fractured Identity exiles Bot1's Dyadrine (2 counters, cast for {G}{W}) and Bot2
# creates a token that's a copy of it. A token is never cast, so "equal to the amount of mana spent to cast it" is zero (CR 614.1c,
# 601.2h; the ruling for a copy): the token is a 0/1 with no counters. Bot1's card is in exile.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Dyadrine, Synthesis Amalgam
Swamp x4
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Fractured Identity
Mox Emerald
Swamp
Swamp x10

